{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"99869","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/99869","key":"MC-201759","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"08/Oct/20 3:20 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>Despite obsidian and crying obsidian being obsidians they are not grouped together in the creative inventory.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Open the creative inventory and navigate to the Building Blocks tab</li>\n\t<li>Scroll down until you find obsidian<br>\n<img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> Crying obsidian is far below it, instead of next to it</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedbehavior\"></a>Expected behavior</h3>\n<p>Crying obsidian would be grouped with and shown next to obsidian in the creative inventory.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"09/Oct/20 9:15 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/131056","id":"131056","filename":"2020-10-06_07.31.14.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7f40dd62077a774a3d6dc2fd889a697e?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAC-0.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7f40dd62077a774a3d6dc2fd889a697e?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAC-0.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7f40dd62077a774a3d6dc2fd889a697e?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAC-